# 统一换行符，避免 Windows 开发机把 CRLF 提交进仓库。
# Docker 构建上下文里若混入 CRLF，shell 脚本与 Dockerfile 会出问题。
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.vue text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.cjs text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.sqlite binary
*.svg text eol=lf
